  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The Views**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the application\'s views. I\'ve started with `HomeView.tsx`, aiming for a search bar with placeholder text (\"Search events, artists, venues...\") and several category filter pills that include \"All Events\", \"Nightlife\", \"Concert,\" and \"Culture,\" to name a few. I\'m prioritizing user experience and navigation for a streamlined interface.\n\n\n**Defining View Functionality**\n\nI\'ve moved on to fleshing out the functionality for different views. I am working on the ExploreView, which includes interactive city maps and filters. The CreateEventView is taking shape with all the necessary form fields, including date pickers and image uploads. I\'m also planning the ModerationView, with search and filtering for admins.\n\n\n**Implementing Profile Features**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `ProfileView`, precisely replicating the design with an avatar, VIP badge, and interactive toggles for connected accounts (Facebook, Instagram, TikTok) and privacy settings. \"My Tickets\" view and a \"Sign Out\" button are also in development. Additionally, I\'m working on the `AuthView`, crafting the login screen with a geometric backdrop and login button.\n\n\n"
