  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Supabase Client**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the Supabase client. Specifically, I need to create the `/src/services/supabase.ts` file. My goal is to enable the app to read environment variables for Supabase URL and key, but also provide live configuration options for testing. This will allow for instant connection.\n\n\n**Defining Supabase Methods**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining the specific Supabase methods I\'ll need. This includes functions for event management (retrieval, creation, status updates), ticket handling (creation, retrieval, scanning, with an RPC fallback), and transaction processing. The transaction function will include automatic fee calculation, with percentages for promoter, Thiesdn, and mobile money fees. I\'ll also add methods for user profile management.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now designing an interactive financial dashboard for promoters and admins, focusing on displaying sales volume, commission splits (90/10), mobile money fees, and detailed transaction history with export options. I\'m also working on enhancements to the scanner view, adding camera scan simulation, sound/haptic feedback, and a confetti celebration upon successful ticket scans. A Supabase schema setup guide modal is also in the works.\n\n\n"
